Gourmet Organization hires Toriko to harvest the legendary Rainbow Fruit, but the famed hunter will have to prove he's tougher than an entire nest of Troll Kongs before he can finish the job!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-04-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mLV5oK2OK1qkzNlI2WBc8v4z8kH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mLV5oK2OK1qkzNlI2WBc8v4z8kH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"858201","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and Komatsu set out to capture a Puffer Whale, but this daring quest to satisfy their exotic appetites may be the death of them both! Lucky for them, King Coco is along for the ride!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7KUd01DBmZZDbTcDzksm3Hl9tmP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7KUd01DBmZZDbTcDzksm3Hl9tmP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"858207","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komatsu is kidnapped by a gourmet hunter who wants to use the boy as bait. Toriko and Coco are his only hope for survival, but they've got their hands full battling a deadly Devil Python!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sDQmVZTd3KL6LFtgfZnSoVQIBvl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sDQmVZTd3KL6LFtgfZnSoVQIBvl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"858206","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komatsu finds himself face-to-face with a Devil Python, and the secret weapon Toriko gave him might get the young chef killed! Even if he survives, a daunting task lies ahead: removing the poison from a priceless Puffer Whale!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQ32KQZzqcKyWBWe4nFoenA3v1O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQ32KQZzqcKyWBWe4nFoenA3v1O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"858204","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Amidst the emergence of a horrifying new breed of evil, Toriko and Komatsu are hired by the IGO to track down the elusive and delicious Regal Mammoth and its priceless Jewel Meat!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/npb9pec2LtYvQ8iwiCOEdmBO3XQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npb9pec2LtYvQ8iwiCOEdmBO3XQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"858205","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko's epic rumble with the legendary Battle Wolf is derailed by an unexpected new arrival and the interference of an insanely evil representative of the Gourmet Corp!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eFZcRIPb3lMB79w2VzNYvjMwWcz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eFZcRIPb3lMB79w2VzNYvjMwWcz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"858208","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko fights and defeats the GT Robo. He then adapts the baby battle wolf as his pet, which he names Terry Cloth. Mansam tells Komatsu about Gourmet Cells but does not provide any more details. The Bishoku-kai are revealed to be after the Regal Mammoth as well. At the end the group has a feast (Mansam's Full Course).","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYpjwUsnzLHUHIWs389BdE0mkt3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYpjwUsnzLHUHIWs389BdE0mkt3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"858209","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and the gang are on the hunt for a Regal Mammoth when they cross paths with the Heavenly King, Sunny. With GT Robots on the prowl and Rock Drums dead ahead, they'll need Sunny's help to survive!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eaJBaQ4nxBj2H6MQ2Zg6QrFypYE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eaJBaQ4nxBj2H6MQ2Zg6QrFypYE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"858210","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While the villainous GT Robots continue their search for mammoth meat, Toriko has his hands full battling an ornery Obasaurus, and Komatsu learns the powerful secrets of the Gourmet Cells.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bfUguI2p5k2fPrkX55zvnp10pWs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bfUguI2p5k2fPrkX55zvnp10pWs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"858211","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko's daring attempt to navigate the Devils' Playground brings him face-to-face with a Soldier Frog, an Axeox, and an Avian Beast with hallucinogenic breath! Meanwhile, a GT Robot stalks the Regal Mammoth.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3j1IGzt2EB0Z77oUhNAPB7BiSrv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3j1IGzt2EB0Z77oUhNAPB7BiSrv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"858213","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko's quick thinking saves Sunny and Komatsu from being crush by a mammoth, but there are greater threats looming. A giant GT Robot is ready to rumble, and the Gourmet Hunters are all out of strength.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4QaGmJQsmgFqkShbCiCSjXI217S.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4QaGmJQsmgFqkShbCiCSjXI217S.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"858212","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Toriko searches for the priceless Jewel Meat, Sunny and Coco wage separate battles against deadly GT Robots! Will Sunny's hair leash and Coco's poison rifle be enough secure victory?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7d37E9xv8Rkh6qHwYf5nHZ8Jr1d.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7d37E9xv8Rkh6qHwYf5nHZ8Jr1d.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"858214","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sunny's battle with the GT Robot is complicated by the arrival of a Mega Octopus, and something extremely evil hunts Toriko and his famished friends!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3uw61aWgLOYyjdxn9CI40YmTbLj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3uw61aWgLOYyjdxn9CI40YmTbLj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"858216","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rin's tragic end sends Toriko into a rage, but the price of fueling his passionate attack may cost him his life. Meanwhile, Komatsu takes a heroic stand when the GT Robot tries to rob the chef of his favorite knife!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nH7nkI3rCPRKD1pp4GmJJn81ZKQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nH7nkI3rCPRKD1pp4GmJJn81ZKQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"858215","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A bite of the delicious Jewel Meat energizes Toriko, who uses a vicious Ten-Fold Spike Punch to put the hurt on a GT Robot! When the dust finally settles on the battlefield, dinner will be served!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9DtDqIllucGUV58lXSpGLkugL5K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9DtDqIllucGUV58lXSpGLkugL5K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"858217","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komatsu must find an exquisite sauce to top a dish of very rare fish, and Toriko prepares to venture deep into the deadly Wu Jungle in search of food fit for a Battle Wolf!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bbBfo8AcpAuD8xCLmbFuLRVYYrA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bbBfo8AcpAuD8xCLmbFuLRVYYrA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"858218","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Time is running out for Komatsu to complete his fishy dish, and Toriko watches as Terry faces off against a beastly Zombie Wood. Will the Battle Wolf show his true power - or fall to his ferocious foe?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hfvD6Gc7EHNzofcA8jBvTmEegsj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfvD6Gc7EHNzofcA8jBvTmEegsj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"858219","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and Terry finally find the deliciously elusive BB Corn, and Komatsu must depend on a special blend of spices to survive an encounter with a giant lizard!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kBNUBpABZjFssOkwM9NRbAteZaa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kBNUBpABZjFssOkwM9NRbAteZaa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"858220","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko must take his powers to the next level if he hopes to defeat a ravenous assassin from the Gourmet Corps. Elsewhere, Komatsu learns of the legendary ingredient with the power to stop - or start - wars!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ezqVTjvz4RNSD7VCCfESPuyPrwq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezqVTjvz4RNSD7VCCfESPuyPrwq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"858221","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko continues his battle with the corn-stealing, straw-wielding villain known as Grinpatch, and Komatsu desperately races to make it home before a rare dish of fish becomes nothing more than bubbles!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nvANcGtTnkTECCvcVCokKrm3JSu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nvANcGtTnkTECCvcVCokKrm3JSu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"858222","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and Komatsu travel to the city of culinary dreams for a special dinner with a living gourmet legend! Elsewhere, the sinister Gourmet Corps reveal the secrets behind their desperate desire for the Jewel Meat!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qfVgxk2z6cQIPm0yXjxHZ7XUvNc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qfVgxk2z6cQIPm0yXjxHZ7XUvNc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"858223","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komatsu and Toriko are treated to an ultra-exclusive tour of Setsuno's kitchen, including the top secret area where she prepares Century Soup! Inspired, they set off in search of the genuine article, but trouble lies ahead!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/60Wy9rNlIRaZoJevB846LXeSoul.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/60Wy9rNlIRaZoJevB846LXeSoul.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"858224","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko, Komatsu, and a ravenous army of Gourmet Hunters set off in search of the legendary Century Soup. Their journey will take them to Ice Hell, but they'll have to survive a Sharkrocodile attack to arrive in one piece!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rSpVP53HKClkaNVdZhodA5XdJpr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSpVP53HKClkaNVdZhodA5XdJpr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"858226","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tundra Dragons and killer icicles are just a few of the obstacles standing between Toriko and the Century Soup. If the elements don't kill him, there is a mean, green, GT Robot waiting to finish the job!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bmaKwnOTnZPE4hDoYk7nHswxAPE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmaKwnOTnZPE4hDoYk7nHswxAPE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"858227","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Episodio 27","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Zonge stumbles upon a group of angry Growlruses, Toriko and company go head-to-head with a herd of ferocious Freezer Bison, and a villainous vice chef unleashes an army of beastly insects!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a2U3KNwQLVPsQtqcvK6s71lW45F.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a2U3KNwQLVPsQtqcvK6s71lW45F.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"858225","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and Komatsu team up to turn a deadly Silver Grizzly into a scrumptious soup. A villainous member of the Gourmet Corps is hot on their trail, but help is on the way in the form of a Heavenly King!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fUnWqk0iDjADkkN388wilXpfJgk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fUnWqk0iDjADkkN388wilXpfJgk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"858228","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Toriko's hand is frozen solid during a deadly encounter with a Gourmet Corps bug tamer, the burden of collecting the Century Soup falls squarely on the small shoulders of Komatsu! Is the little chef up to such a big task?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qDbZR8uZQ4eUO2Aee6LiWVxNI70.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDbZR8uZQ4eUO2Aee6LiWVxNI70.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"858229","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko fights to survive a deadly swarm of insects, and Takimaru fights for his life against an unbreakable opponent. Meanwhile, Komatsu's quest to collect the Century Soup is monitored by GT Robot!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXmJrWqtdF1jEdHIzV9H7GXlpcI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXmJrWqtdF1jEdHIzV9H7GXlpcI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"858231","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takimaru relies on lessons from his past to settle the score with his flexible foe, and Match puts his blade to the ultimate test against an opponent clad in Crash Turtle armor!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ai8V8O2mDh6Jz1WuQhyjoaMUCmA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ai8V8O2mDh6Jz1WuQhyjoaMUCmA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"858230","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko heats things up in a heroic attempt to end the insect onslaught! Elsewhere, Komatsu finally reaches the location of the Century Soup - only to find that there is no soup!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yYnQkfunX9BeTQKDVQpyjm27Fjv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yYnQkfunX9BeTQKDVQpyjm27Fjv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"858232","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komatsu learns the amazing truth about his mysterious new friend, and Toriko relies on the power of his Gourmet Cells to even the odds in his brutal showdown with Tommyrod.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lukCdoDNjTJeqJ8sGPtTwyhCRMz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lukCdoDNjTJeqJ8sGPtTwyhCRMz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"858233","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko attempts to end his epic battle with Tommyrod by unleashing a Thirteen-Hit Nail Punch, but the bug tamer counters by revealing the true depths of his devious strength.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fBu9LBnJFrAYoBI5HItNqq0ASxP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fBu9LBnJFrAYoBI5HItNqq0ASxP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"858234","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The sudden arrival of a powerful Gourmet Reviver prompts Tommyrod to shed his skin, giving birth to a monstrous Parasite Emperor. The buggy beast is big and bad, but will he survive a bout with Hellboros, the ruler of Ice Hell?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2emQHEmtF4oahf4K7IqxeLSjRL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2emQHEmtF4oahf4K7IqxeLSjRL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"858235","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komatsu was sad, failing to capture the Century Soup but Teppei has one more amazing trick up his sleeve. With evil forces bearing down on them, will any of our heroes live to tell of their adventure?.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uJWFFU1xovVacTxTfcVlUivx8B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uJWFFU1xovVacTxTfcVlUivx8B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"858238","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After being rescued by Granny Setsu, the weary and wounded adventurers set a course for the healing country known as Life. Toriko has an arm to regenerate, and Komatsu is eager to recreate the Century Soup.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHeiQabS3a8E3UUY0oc38teTiFs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pHeiQabS3a8E3UUY0oc38teTiFs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"858237","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko's gang arrives in the healing country of Life, an amazing land of curative creatures that can treat almost any ailment. After a chance meeting with Sani, the group visits Teppei's master, a renowned - and rowdy - Reviver.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/opXIrjCUBfJri82Tt2zafNiI9Wr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/opXIrjCUBfJri82Tt2zafNiI9Wr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"858236","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko's recovery progresses faster than expected, but the strain of growing a new arm may cost him his life. Meanwhile, Komatsu struggles to find the final ingredient for his Century Soup.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sqdHj5Z2CtCWdl1jFYpFlzIns4E.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sqdHj5Z2CtCWdl1jFYpFlzIns4E.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"858241","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the help of an unusual ingredient, Komatsu finally completes the Century Soup. Thanks to the little chef's big accomplishment, Toriko may get his arm back, and add an ingredient to his Full Course Menu of Life.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/43PPWP8YMHnTf1dAC7hzgjaYZsy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43PPWP8YMHnTf1dAC7hzgjaYZsy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"858240","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko needs to build a new candy house and contracts an architect named Smile to do so.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tXEcUZwojileC8i4yrrYINwVDyn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tXEcUZwojileC8i4yrrYINwVDyn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"858239","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko, Sani, and Coco set out on a death-defying quest to see who can track down the most irresistible sweets for a starving Seven-Color Nessie.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c4IJfsfEnb3E7Lni4QwAP0hYG97.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4IJfsfEnb3E7Lni4QwAP0hYG97.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"858242","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sharkbox Turtles, Honey Dragons, and a Chomp Urchin plague the Heavenly Kings in their mission to feed the Seven-Color Nessie. Can they survive this perilous quest and satisfy the starving beast?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r9WKj5CPS7SVQu3Aq4cSuDFrA2s.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9WKj5CPS7SVQu3Aq4cSuDFrA2s.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"858243","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko tests out his new battle techniques - and his brand new arm - in a ferocious fistfight with the IGO President. Though his strength has improved, Toriko will need more training before he's ready for the Gourmet World.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qcvCKTQlzknroDCW2lfBxmDfq3P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qcvCKTQlzknroDCW2lfBxmDfq3P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"858245","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko begins his training with a mission to collect the delicious Ozone Grass. Komatsu is along for the ride, but is the little chef ready for brutal battles against Flying Sea Lions, Air Gorillas, and a Killer Bean Tree!?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v7oG6ceca7KKTahsqToeuVSCUg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v7oG6ceca7KKTahsqToeuVSCUg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"858244","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and Komatsu continue their quest to collect the Ozone Grass, but their journey only grows more difficult. Before they arrive at the garden in the sky, they must pass through a deadly thunderstorm.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8kSW2kDq1qetdYFjtDx1PcKO1IT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kSW2kDq1qetdYFjtDx1PcKO1IT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"858246","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toriko and Komatsu finally reach the Ozone Grass, but the legendary ingredient proves challenging to harvest. As the culinary adventurers struggle to satisfy their appetites, something sinister watches the scene unfold.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-03-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kKiiGWwgouIYlPWSrCzitrlhoTj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKiiGWwgouIYlPWSrCzitrlhoTj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"858248","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Before completing their mission to capture the Ozone Grass, Toriko and Komatsu encounter an unusual beast that's identical to a GT Robot. What is this new menace, and what does it want?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-03-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7GRg3aqWdS7DX4p4VmtgrA6DzJu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7GRg3aqWdS7DX4p4VmtgrA6DzJu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"858247","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Eager to test his new abilities in the Gourmet World, Toriko ignores the warnings of his closest friends and goes in search of adventure. Meanwhile, Komatsu is shocked by an unexpected visitor.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-03-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5OvAYOVzDZg0YsLyiKyZr1cEoX0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5OvAYOVzDZg0YsLyiKyZr1cEoX0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1/episode/49"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38251/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"13":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"14":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"15":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"16":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"17":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"18":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"19":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"20":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"21":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"22":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"23":{"checkedAt":1793480082436,"status":"ok","retryCount